File Index: 13 of 109
Audio ID: 7693123056339910585
Audio Duration: 2m 21.1s (141.14s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:16:49 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 11 | Text: 不要去共情一个不是你这个阶层的人
Segment #2   [00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,200] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 有一句话说
Segment #3   [00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,320] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 你以慈悲看世界
Segment #4   [00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,000] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个世界都是可怜人
Segment #5   [00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,400] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 10 | Text: 但如果你要用因果去看这个世界
Segment #6   [00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,040] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个世界没一个是可怜人
Segment #7   [00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,100] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 14 | Text: 这个世界上每个人都配得上他现在的生活
Segment #8   [00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,880] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 换句话说就是他现在的生活
Segment #9   [00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,980] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 12 | Text: 是他过去无数次选择的结果
Segment #10  [00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,200] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 12 | Text: 请记住他的认知配得上他的苦难
Segment #11  [00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,940] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 这句话听着很冷漠
Segment #12  [00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,260] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是他真的是事实
Segment #13  [00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,840] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 14 | Text: 如果你把一个人带到原本不属于他的高度
Segment #14  [00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,840] | Elapsed:  14.38s | Words: 17 | Text: 他的思想往往是跟不上这个境界和他的阶层的
Segment #15  [00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,120] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 12 | Text: 他的愚昧无知最终会害了他自己
Segment #16  [00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,280] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 同时也把你拖下水
Segment #17  [00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,380] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 甚至会产生恶果
Segment #18  [00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,060] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 变成刺向你的那把刀
Segment #19  [00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,200] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 世间所有机遇
Segment #20  [00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,740] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 13 | Text: 从来不是凭空降临的愧疚或劫难
Segment #21  [00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,260] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是一个人认知格局
Segment #22  [00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,300] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 12 | Text: 与选择层层跌下的最终答案
Segment #23  [00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,320] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 11 | Text: 很多人总轻易对他人的困难
Segment #24  [00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,080] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 心生怜悯
Segment #25  [00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,420] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 忍不住伸手帮扶
Segment #26  [00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,340] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 11 | Text: 妄图打破对方酒破的现状
Segment #27  [00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,400] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 11 | Text: 却忽略了一个最本质的真相
Segment #28  [00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,340] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 15 | Text: 每个人的人生轨迹都是由过往每一次取舍
Segment #29  [00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:53,820] | Elapsed:  33.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 每一次判断
Segment #30  [00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,540] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 10 | Text: 每一次懈怠与坚持住旧的
Segment #31  [00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:57,000] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 有人深陷生活的泥潭
Segment #32  [00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,340] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 看似命运不公
Segment #33  [00:00:58,340 --> 00:01:00,100] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 9  | Text: 实则是长期认知狭隘
Segment #34  [00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,460] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 13 | Text: 思维固化不愿改变的必然结果
Segment #35  [00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,940] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 15 | Text: 认知局限的人永远看不清事物的本质
Segment #36  [00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,100] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 既不懂顺时而为
Segment #37  [00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,260] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 也不愿生生自我
Segment #38  [00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:08,940] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 9  | Text: 在该努力是贪图安逸
Segment #39  [00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:10,380] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 该知损时心存侥幸
Segment #40  [00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:12,000] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 该沉淀时浮躁忙从
Segment #41  [00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,540] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 一次次错误的选择
Segment #42  [00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:15,500] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 11 | Text: 慢慢堆砌出了自己的苦难人生
Segment #43  [00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:17,200] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 你以为的血中松碳
Segment #44  [00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,880] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 9  | Text: 在认知不匹配的人眼中
Segment #45  [00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:19,740] | Elapsed:  52.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 未必是善意
Segment #46  [00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:21,500] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 10 | Text: 反而可能是理所当然的亏证
Segment #47  [00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:23,560] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 11 | Text: 甚至是可以肆意消耗的资源
Segment #48  [00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:26,020] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 13 | Text: 他们无法理解你所属阶层的规则
Segment #49  [00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,220] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 5  | Text: 格局与底线
Segment #50  [00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:29,400] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 11 | Text: 也存在不起突如其来的机遇
Segment #51  [00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:31,360] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 10 | Text: 强行拉拔他人跨越阶层
Segment #52  [00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,320] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 11 | Text: 本质上是违背规律的徒劳
Segment #53  [00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,740] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 8  | Text: 一个人的圈层与高度
Segment #54  [00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,860] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 12 | Text: 从来不是外力强行堆砌的疲劳
Segment #55  [00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:38,560] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是认知、眼界、心性
Segment #56  [00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,660] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 8  | Text: 与能力的综合沉淀
Segment #57  [00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:41,980] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 14 | Text: 当能力和思维配不上所处的位置
Segment #58  [00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:44,120] | Elapsed:  72.33s | Words: 13 | Text: 所有的帮扶与亏证都会变成隐患
Segment #59  [00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,880] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 9  | Text: 他会用自己的浅薄认知
Segment #60  [00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,880] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 看待你的善意
Segment #61  [00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,840] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 10 | Text: 用狭隘格局揣测你的付出
Segment #62  [00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,960] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 一旦利益相背
Segment #63  [00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,200] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 或是遭遇挫折困境
Segment #64  [00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,840] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 非但不会感谢你的提携
Segment #65  [00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:55,560] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 16 | Text: 反而会归咎于你把自身的无能与不幸
Segment #66  [00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,560] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 转嫁到你身上
Segment #67  [00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,640] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 13 | Text: 心让无尺度往往是祸断的开断
Segment #68  [00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,340] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 适度的善良是修养
Segment #69  [00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:01,680] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 过度的共情是鱼吃
Segment #70  [00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,760] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 12 | Text: 不必为他人的苦难过度被迷
Segment #71  [00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,020] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 更不要强行救赎
Segment #72  [00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:06,020] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 认知不匹配的人
Segment #73  [00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,900] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 9  | Text: 每个人都有自己的人生功课
Segment #74  [00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:10,380] | Elapsed:  91.64s | Words: 13 | Text: 每一份苦难都是认知觉醒的代价
Segment #75  [00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:12,760] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 13 | Text: 每一种境遇都是命运的公平回馈
Segment #76  [00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,000] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 守住自己的圈层
Segment #77  [00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,240] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 克制泛滥的善意
Segment #78  [00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,660] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 尊重英国与规律
Segment #79  [00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:18,980] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 14 | Text: 才是保护自己清醒处事的最高智慧
Segment #80  [00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:20,020] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油 陌生人
Segment #81  [00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:20,980] | Elapsed: 102.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
